'''Sharky''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was obtainable by collecting 2,500 '''Beach Balls''' {{Currency|Beach Ball}} , and purchasing the 7th tier in the [[Summer Event 2024]]. It Is now only obtainable though trading as the event has ended

== Appearance ==
The blade of this knife is colored to resemble a shark (a great white shark specifically), hence the name. The handle has a grey wrapping around the middle bottom, but is overall blue.

